The lower frame of Figure 2.11 shows that the RMS value of the differences between the INL curves obtained via the THUB and the CANbus setups has a channel dependence. All twelve channel 0 standard deviations are lower than the standard deviations of the other channels. Channel 3 has larger standard deviations than the

